#: ../../openmvcam/shields/tv-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/tv-shield.rst:6
msgid "TV Shield"
msgstr "TV Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/tv-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The TV Shield gives the OpenMV Cam an NTSC analog video output via a "
"VS23S010 SPI-to-NTSC video generator, driving an on-board RCA jack so you "
"can plug a composite video display straight into the camera."
msgstr ""
"Il TV Shield dota la OpenMV Cam di un'uscita video analogica NTSC tramite un"
" generatore video SPI-NTSC VS23S010, pilotando un jack RCA integrato in modo"
" da poter collegare un display video composito direttamente alla camera."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/tv-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `TV Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/tv-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Per il datasheet completo, le foto e gli ordini, consulta la `pagina "
"prodotto del TV Shield <https://openmv.io/products/tv-shield>`_\\ ."

